        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#1$1",
            "duration": 1.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2.5
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diligent Guard",
        "text": "Phew\u2014Zone 2 is finally all cleaned up, now it's just Zone 4 left. How are you doing? Tough work, eh? Want to take a break?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "I'm cleaning just as fast as you are, as you can plainly see."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#2$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "You don't need to try and accommodate me just because I'm an Infected."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diligent Guard",
        "text": "That's not it at all. I just thought you must be tired, with everything you've been through and all."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#2$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "Oh, I thought... never mind. As for that incident with the crown, I'm fully clear on that now."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diligent Guard",
        "text": "It was just a spur-of-the-moment thing! Besides, you're not the only one who wanted to do that."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diligent Guard",
        "text": "Actually, it seems like all of a sudden, people aren't as afraid of the Infected anymore."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "That's because we're in Londinium. The policies instituted by the Speaker and Parliament have, at the very least, stopped many people from openly showing fear and resentment towards the Infected."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "But according to a Columbian friend of mine, outside of Londinium, things haven't changed."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diligent Guard",
        "text": "Anyway, thanks for helping with the cleanup; we would've had the captain on us again without you."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#8$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "I should be the one thanking you for not shackling me. Having something to do helps put my mind at ease."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diligent Guard",
        "text": "If you ask me, you need not worry about Parliament's decision. Think about it. Of all the places in Londinium where they could have detained you, why did they choose the Defense Forces' lockup?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diligent Guard",
        "text": "It's because we're all either old war buddies or familiar faces who can look out for you. Don't worry. Once things cool down, we'll find a reason for you to go home."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diligent Guard",
        "text": "The protestors outside the Speaker's office, they're the ones who are missing the picture. We all know what kind of person Vina is."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#6$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diligent Guard",
        "text": "Hmm? Are you feeling alright? Do you need something to drink?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#2$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "You're saying... the Speaker is going to release me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diligent Guard",
        "text": "I'm saying just rest here for now, where it's safe, until things die down out there."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diligent Guard",
        "text": "The captain didn't allow you to have a radio or read the newspaper, right? It's because he was worried that you might get to thinking too much."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#2$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diligent Guard",
        "text": "If you're still feeling jittery, my good buddy\u2014he gets thrown in the drunk tank every few days\u2014he's stashed some premium hooch around here somewhere."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diligent Guard",
        "text": "I'll go grab a few bottles for you."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
            "volume": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "posfrom": "0,0",
            "posto": "-200,0",
            "duration": 1.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "afrom": 1,
            "ato": 0,
            "duration": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 4.5
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Diane gives a faint, wry smile as she strains to catch the sounds coming from outside."
    },
    {
        "text": "But aside from the faint sound of water running through pipes, she hears nothing but the distant drills of the Defense Forces."
    },
    {
        "text": "Ever since she was brought in here, she has been more or less cut off from the outside world."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "I wonder if Eliseo is doing alright?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "I really should have let him know beforehand. He must be so worried about me now\u2026"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#2$1",
            "focus": "none"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Indeed. He went to nearly everyone he knows to plead on your behalf."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#6$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "Madam Speaker!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
            "volume": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#8$1",
            "duration": 1.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2.5
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "Good. They aren't treating you like some common criminal."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "And you made sure of that?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#9$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "No. They did it on their own\u2014they believe you don't deserve this sentence."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#8$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "Many came to me on your behalf. Your friends, my friends\u2026 our comrades-in-arms, and even some civilians who don't know you at all."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
            "volume": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
            "duration": 1.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2.5
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diligent Guard",
        "text": "\u2014Diane, I snatched some of my buddy's liquor for you."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "He takes a big swig of whiskey."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diligent Guard",
        "text": "Urk!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Before the soldier even reaches Diane and Vina, he snaps to attention, the whiskey caught awkwardly in his mouth\u2014too afraid to swallow or spit it out."
    },
    {
        "text": "He quickly hides the bottle behind him and salutes Vina."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diligent Guard",
        "text": "Gulp!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#8$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "No need to hide it, Patel."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "As I recall, Horn did mention that drinking is prohibited in the barracks."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diligent Guard",
        "text": "(Swallows) Uhh... ahem\u2026"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diligent Guard",
        "text": "Yes, Vina! But\u2026 this is\u2026 uh\u2026"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#8$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "I won't tell Horn, but in return, you'll keep my visiting Diane a secret."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "And set the bottle down, will you? Weren't you bringing it to Diane, anyway?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diligent Guard",
        "text": "Uh\u2026 alright. Vina, you came here to discuss the plans with Diane, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#7$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2.5
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_422_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diligent Guard",
        "text": "See, Diane? I told you not to worry, didn't I?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diligent Guard",
        "text": "I'll go finish cleaning Zone 4. I've been on duty all day, and I didn't see anyone here."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "stopmusic",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 1.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
            "volume": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "duration": 1.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 3.5
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#8$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "Would you like a taste of the whiskey Patel left? It doesn't smell all that bad."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "key": "$wasteland_loop",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Diane shakes her head slightly, a bit downcast."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#8$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "Mind if I have a sip, then? Meeting with those dukes has left me parched."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "Madam Speaker, did you put me here because you really wanted to\u2026?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#8$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "We thought you'd feel better among old friends. You would rather I threw you in solitary?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "No, of course not."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#5$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "Honestly, I'm not as resolute as you think. My past isn't much different from yours, or from that of most Londiniers."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "Diane, I did hesitate over my decision."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#8$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "So, does your visit mean Parliament has come to a verdict?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#7$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "(Sigh) I feel it best that I inform you of Parliament's decision in person."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "I bid you adieu, Lieutenant Diane Weber of the former 6th Column, 10th Infantry Regiment. You are unquestionably a war hero."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "Thank you for your great service to our homeland."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "Parliament...? I see. Madam Speaker, when will it happen?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "Tomorrow."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "Have you any regrets?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#8$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "Have you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "Perhaps my biggest regret is that, after the war, I didn't immediately strip off this outfit and hide myself away back in Norport."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#8$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "Ha, you would never have done that. I know you. The Siege will never abandon our homeland, and the Speaker of Londinium will never abandon Victoria."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#7$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "...Hah."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#8$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "I have no regrets either, Vina\u2014may I call you that?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#8$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "You may."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#8$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "We've met many times and fought side by side just as often. But today, I think, is the first day we can truly call ourselves friends."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "Vina, before I go, would you share a drink with me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 0,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "When you walked alone into the Palace of Westhaleg, everyone believed that the woman who emerged would be wearing the crown."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "'A hero must one day be crowned king.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "Every collection of fairytales in that old bookstore on Baker Street had a story like that. It was my favorite place to go before I enlisted."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "I really did want to witness history, Vina."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#5$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "But I let you down. I let a lot of people down."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "Yes... You could have been a great ruler."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#5$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "Just because I wanted to make Londinium a better place? Didn't the old king, the one who was hanged public, also want to make Londinium, to make all of Victoria, a better place?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "Things rarely go as planned."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "Sometimes, what you believe is right may look wrong to others. I've only recently begun to understand that."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "Then what is there to do?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "I'm still searching for that answer, Diane."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#7$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "Someone I trust told me to try to accept those who hate me and to stand firm in my own sense of justice\u2026"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#5$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "I'm still learning\u2026 but I never imagined this path would be so lonely."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "You're drunk\u2026 Vina."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Vina shakes her head. She draws her sword and hands it to Diane."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#8$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "Do you remember Kyngasycath, the Sighs of Kings?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "Yes. I took it from your own hands, after all."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#8$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "After the battle, I discovered that it had completely dulled. The smiths worked tirelessly, day and night, to reforge it for me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "This new sword is heavier. It carries the weight of even greater expectations than before."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "Diane, this sword reminds me every day of the right path\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#9$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "The future of Victoria doesn't rest with me or Parliament. It rests on all of you\u2014those who reclaimed our home with their own strength."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "Vina, I have one last question."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "What really happened in the Palace of Westhaleg that day?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#8$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "What kind of story would you like to hear?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "A heroic fairytale that'll make it into the books of that old bookstore, or the truth, so plain that it's almost boring?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#8$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "Haha."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Diane takes a long swig of her drink, her hand brushing over the cold steel of the sword."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "To be honest, I prefer the old sword\u2026 When I used it to strike down our enemies, those were the moments I felt closest to Victoria."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "Back when I was living a simple, uneventful life, I never imagined I'd have thoughts like these\u2026"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "And besides, there's hardly any time left to savor those quiet, pre-war days, is there?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "Vina, forgive me, but I can't save the last bit of this whiskey for you. I really need it\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1519_1#5$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "(Choking up) Why now, of all times, am I suddenly afraid to die?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Diane",
        "text": "(Choking back tears) Vina, before I'm completely drunk, would you tell me one last fairytale?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Her tears fall on the sword, sliding down its blade. 'Drip', 'drip'..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "Diane\u2026 you already know the stories of the past, and you were there for the best parts of this fairytale."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "But you may not know how it ends."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#7$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "That day, I entered the Palace of Westhaleg, tore down the Sarkaz banner, and was about to leave\u2014when suddenly, I heard someone call my name from the throne room."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "'Alexandrina Vina Victoria.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "Then I pushed open the door that had been sealed for so long."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1019_siege2_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "I saw\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "stopmusic",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 2.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 0,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "image",
        "params": {
            "image": "55_i11",
            "fadetime": 0
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "imagetween",
        "params": {
            "yfrom": 450,
            "y": 130,
            "xscalefrom": 1.8,
            "yscalefrom": 1.8,
            "xscale": 1.3,
