        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$chernobog_intro",
            "key": "$chernobog_loop",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 5
    },
    {
        "text": "my father. Alistair II, speaking to me."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alistair II",
        "text": "My Alexandrina! You're finally home."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alistair II",
        "text": "Come sit by my side, daughter of Victoria."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "image",
        "params": {
            "image": "55_i11",
            "fadetime": 3.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "imagetween",
        "params": {
            "xscalefrom": 1,
            "yscalefrom": 1,
            "xscale": 0.8,
            "yscale": 0.8,
            "duration": 60,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 4.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Vina couldn't make out the King's face."
    },
    {
        "text": "The golden mask blended with his golden hair, radiating authority and an air of mystery."
    },
    {
        "text": "He was Victoria personified."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alistair II",
        "text": "My daughter, are you afraid of me? Are you afraid of Victoria?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alistair II",
        "text": "Vina, never reveal even the slightest hint of fear to your subjects. Your teacher should have taught you that."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "You died long ago."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "Twenty-six years ago, they hanged you from the gallows."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alistair II",
        "text": "Laughable! Who could kill Victoria?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alistair II",
        "text": "Those greedy condorwings thought they could tear the flesh from my body to feed themselves."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alistair II",
        "text": "They were so blinded by fear that they conspired in regicide, all so they could feast upon the lands of the Aslans for their own gain."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alistair II",
        "text": "But no one can kill us\u2014not the dukes, not the Red Dragon. We are the beating heart of Victoria!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "So that's why\u2026 your statue in the Mausoleum of Kings was never completed\u2026"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "The dukes never truly laid you to rest; you've been here all along."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alistair II",
        "text": "What little courage they possessed drove them to confine me in this throne room, but never to claim my throne. Cowardly usurpers!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alistair II",
        "text": "They fear my people; they fear my Steam Knights; they fear us, Vina."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alistair II",
        "text": "My daughter, tell me, do my people still remember me? Do my knights still guard our palace?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "The people of Victoria have long since adapted to life without a monarch. As for your knights, they're all gone."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "They were murdered by the very people they were sworn to protect."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alistair II",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alistair II",
        "text": "And what of you, Vina?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "I\u2026 I can barely remember what you look like."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alistair II",
        "text": "Then come closer. Take off my mask and look closely\u2026 you'll see only yourself, Alexandrina. The blood of the royal line flows in us both."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alistair II",
        "text": "I'm sorry, my child, that I failed to keep my promise."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alistair II",
        "text": "I intended to hand you a peaceful and powerful Victoria, yet betrayal has left me sitting here, rotting on my throne, for over twenty years."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alistair II",
        "text": "But at last, you've returned. Take my scepter, wear my crown\u2026"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alistair II",
        "text": "Proclaim to our people that their sovereign has returned."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alistair II",
        "text": "Purge our land of all dissent and punish every coward who betrayed the crown. Let glory endure\u2014this is Victoria's rightful way!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_avg_dropspanner",
            "volume": 1,
            "channel": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_avg_tinbuckethit",
            "volume": 1,
            "channel": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "The king's scepter struck heavily against the throne platform, its dull echo reverberating."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "\u2026Blood was never the source of our strength."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alistair II",
        "text": "How familiar those words are\u2014just like my defiant boasts to my own father."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alistair II",
        "text": "(Chuckles) You still have much to learn, my daughter. Let me teach you a long-overdue lesson: the meaning of 'royal power'!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alistair II",
        "text": "Still, I grant you the right to oppose me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Alistair II",
        "text": "Alexandrina, return to my side, and listen."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "No. You're already dead, Your Majesty. All that remains here is your echo, lost in the glories of a bygone empire."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "I do not need you to grant me anything, nor do I need you to validate the strength of my convictions."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Vina",
        "text": "...I just want you to rest in peace, Father."
    },
    {
        "text": "Vina tightened her grip on her hammer, stepped onto the platform, and walked toward the Empire's last glimmer of twilight."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
